# {{name}} website

Static site (no build step): `index.html`, `privacy.html`, `terms.html`, `site.css`, `icon.png`. Generated by app-release-kit from `release-kit.toml`; edit the config and re-run `kit.py init --force`, or edit these files directly.

Address: **https://{{domain}}**. Privacy policy URL for Play Console: **{{privacy_url}}**.

## Deploy (Vercel)
1. Vercel > Add New > Project > import this repository; set **Root Directory** to `website`; framework "Other"; no build command.
2. Project > Settings > Domains > add `{{domain}}`.
3. In the DNS for `{{base_domain}}` add the record Vercel shows (usually `CNAME {{domain}} -> cname.vercel-dns.com`).
4. Open `/privacy` and `/terms`, then paste the privacy URL into Play Console (App content > Privacy policy).

## Link from the products page
Add a card to the "Our Products" section of {{products_url}} (and the footer list):

```html
<div class="scard reveal">
  <div class="scard-icon">&#128241;</div>
  <div class="scard-title">{{name}}</div>
  <p class="scard-desc">{{tagline}}</p>
  <a href="https://{{domain}}/" class="scard-btn scard-btn-outline" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Visit {{name}}</a>
</div>
```
